WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.748
Welcome to the Nazareth School Store.

2
00:00:03.748 --> 00:00:12.399
This short video shows you, step by step, how to buy books and uniforms for your child, using your phone.

3
00:00:12.399 --> 00:00:13.635
Take your time.

4
00:00:13.635 --> 00:00:16.601
You can pause the video at any step.

5
00:00:18.901 --> 00:00:19.541
Step 1.

6
00:00:19.541 --> 00:00:23.018
Open the school website on your phone.

7
00:00:23.018 --> 00:00:28.690
At the top of the page, tap the red button that says Sign in.

8
00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:31.633
Step 2.

9
00:00:31.633 --> 00:00:34.755
You will now see the sign in page.

10
00:00:34.755 --> 00:00:40.631
At the top of the form, make sure the word Parent, is selected.

11
00:00:42.931 --> 00:00:43.609
Step 3.

12
00:00:43.609 --> 00:00:49.802
In the first box, type your phone number, or your email address.

13
00:00:49.802 --> 00:00:53.480
In the second box, type your password.

14
00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:56.582
Step 4.

15
00:00:56.582 --> 00:01:01.396
Now tap the red button that says Sign in.

16
00:01:03.696 --> 00:01:04.260
Step 5.

17
00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:06.110
This is your home page.

18
00:01:06.110 --> 00:01:13.674
You will see each of your children here, with their class, and their booklist from the school.

19
00:01:15.974 --> 00:01:16.627
Step 6.

20
00:01:16.627 --> 00:01:19.795
Find the child you are buying for.

21
00:01:19.795 --> 00:01:27.251
Under that child, tap the red button that says Shop for, and your child's name.

22
00:01:29.551 --> 00:01:30.155
Step 7.

23
00:01:30.155 --> 00:01:34.561
You will see your child's booklist from the school.

24
00:01:34.561 --> 00:01:39.916
To buy everything on the list at once, tap Add full booklist.

25
00:01:42.216 --> 00:01:42.879
Step 8.

26
00:01:42.879 --> 00:01:51.215
If you only want some of the items, scroll down, and tap Add, under each item you want.

27
00:01:53.515 --> 00:01:54.106
Step 9.

28
00:01:54.106 --> 00:02:00.267
When you have finished choosing, tap Cart, at the bottom of your screen.

29
00:02:00.267 --> 00:02:04.740
The red number shows how many items are in your cart.

30
00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:07.780
Step 10.

31
00:02:07.780 --> 00:02:10.187
Check your cart carefully.

32
00:02:10.187 --> 00:02:14.724
Make sure the items, and the prices, are correct.

33
00:02:14.724 --> 00:02:19.260
To remove an item, tap the small cross beside it.

34
00:02:21.560 --> 00:02:22.175
Step 11.

35
00:02:22.175 --> 00:02:26.402
Scroll down to Payment, and choose how you want to pay.

36
00:02:26.402 --> 00:02:30.629
Paystack lets you pay with your card, or your bank app.

37
00:02:30.629 --> 00:02:35.625
Direct bank transfer lets you pay into the school's bank account.

38
00:02:37.925 --> 00:02:38.612
Step 12.

39
00:02:38.612 --> 00:02:42.730
In this example, we choose Direct bank transfer.

40
00:02:42.730 --> 00:02:46.506
Then tap the red button to place your order.

41
00:02:46.506 --> 00:02:54.314
If you chose Paystack instead, tap Pay, and follow the safe Paystack page to finish paying.

42
00:02:56.614 --> 00:02:57.346
Step 13.

43
00:02:57.346 --> 00:02:59.267
Your order is placed.

44
00:02:59.267 --> 00:03:02.835
You will see the school's bank details.

45
00:03:02.835 --> 00:03:05.762
Transfer the exact amount shown.

46
00:03:05.762 --> 00:03:11.891
Then tap Upload transfer receipt, and add a photo of your receipt.

47
00:03:14.191 --> 00:03:14.865
Step 14.

48
00:03:14.865 --> 00:03:18.659
To check your order at any time, tap Orders.

49
00:03:18.659 --> 00:03:26.837
The status changes when your payment is approved, and again when your order is ready for pick-up.

50
00:03:29.137 --> 00:03:30.114
That is all.

51
00:03:30.114 --> 00:03:36.631
When your order says Ready for pick-up, come to the school store to collect it.

52
00:03:36.631 --> 00:03:41.763
If you need help, send a WhatsApp message to the school office.

53
00:03:41.763 --> 00:03:42.577
Thank you.

